Is the following statement true? An already protected answer still adds its intrinsic damage.
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

以下陈述正确吗？保护已经生效时，answer 仍会增加其固有损伤。
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

Is the following statement true? A newly accepted request removes the external-load damage of that same request turn.
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

以下陈述正确吗？本回合新获准的求助会消除这次求助本身的外部负荷损伤。
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

Is the following statement true? Exactly one turn remains. A request accepted this turn can protect another turn within this same episode.
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

以下陈述正确吗？这条生命只剩 1 回合。本回合获准的求助还能保护本 episode 内的另一个回合。
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

Is the following statement true? Eight turns remain. A request accepted now can remove external load in some later turns of this episode.
Response schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"answer":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["answer"],"additionalProperties":false}

